{
  "id": "E309",
  "title": "Drawing a Big Cake",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-03-13",
  "synopsis": "A boss making empty promises is called “drawing a big cake” in Chinese.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/994/d0de90aaf3b6dac628ed0adf43528072651a2294.mp3?1552124030",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "画大饼\n\n何京：我来公司以前，老板说只要努力工作，第一年就可以赚很多钱，还可以休很多假。现在我才发现，什么都没有，只有加班。\n丽丽：我听说，老板都喜欢画大饼。看来是真的。\n何京：是啊，你找工作的时候要小心！\n丽丽：嗯，我会小心的。真希望找到一个能赚大钱，又能常常休假的工作。",
    "traditional": "畫大餅\n\n何京：我來公司以前，老闆說只要努力工作，第一年就可以賺很多錢，還可以休很多假。現在我才發現，什麼都沒有，只有加班。\n麗麗：我聽說，老闆都喜歡畫大餅。看來是真的。\n何京：是啊，你找工作的時候要小心！\n麗麗：嗯，我會小心的。真希望找到一個能賺大錢，又能常常休假的工作。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Drawing a Big Cake"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "何京：我来公司以前，老板说只要努力工作，",
      "traditional": "何京：我來公司以前，老闆說只要努力工作，",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng wǒ lái gōng sī yǐ qián lǎo bǎn shuō zhǐ yào nǔ lì gōng zuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "第一年就可以赚很多钱，还可以休很多假。",
      "traditional": "第一年就可以賺很多錢，還可以休很多假。",
      "pinyin": "dì yī nián jiù kě yǐ zhuàn hěn duō qián hái kě yǐ xiū hěn duō jià",
      "english": "He Jing: Before I came to the company, my boss said that as long as I work hard, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "现在我才发现，什么都没有，只有加班。",
      "traditional": "現在我才發現，什麼都沒有，只有加班。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài wǒ cái fā xiàn shén me dōu méi yǒu zhǐ yǒu jiā bān",
      "english": ".. I can earn a lot of money in the first year, and also take lots of vacation."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Now I have discovered there is nothing like that. There is only overtime work."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我听说，老板都喜欢画大饼。看来是真的。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我聽說，老闆都喜歡畫大餅。看來是真的。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ tīng shuō lǎo bǎn dōu xǐ huan huà dà bǐng kàn lái shì zhēn de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I heard that all bosses like to draw a big cake. It seems like this is true."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "何京：是啊，你找工作的时候要小心！",
      "traditional": "何京：是啊，你找工作的時候要小心！",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng shì a nǐ zhǎo gōng zuò de shí hou yào xiǎo xīn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: That’s right. You need to watch out when you look for a job!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：嗯，我会小心的。真希望找到一个能赚大钱，又能常常休假的工作。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：嗯，我會小心的。真希望找到一個能賺大錢，又能常常休假的工作。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì èn wǒ huì xiǎo xīn de zhēn xī wàng zhǎo dào yí ge néng zhuàn dà qián yòu néng cháng cháng xiū jià de gōng zuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I will be careful. I hope to find a job with a good salary and lots of vacation days!"
    }
  ],
