      "Drawing a Big Cake",
      "",
      "He Jing: Before I came to the company, my boss said that as long as I work hard, ..",
      ".. I can earn a lot of money in the first year, and also take lots of vacation.",
      "Now I have discovered there is nothing like that. There is only overtime work.",
      "",
      "Lili: I heard that all bosses like to draw a big cake. It seems like this is true.",
      "",
      "He Jing: That’s right. You need to watch out when you look for a job!",
      "",
      "Lili: I will be careful. I hope to find a job with a good salary and lots of vacation days!",
      ""
